177	    /**
178	     * The derived key that duplicate detection compares owners by, formed as the normalized
179	     * telephone, the (lower-cased) email or an empty string when absent, and the household id or an
180	     * empty string when absent, joined with {@code '|'}. Two owners are duplicates only when their
181	     * whole identity keys are equal, so members of one household with different telephones (and hence
182	     * different keys) are not duplicates. Derived on read from the stored, already-normalized fields.
183	     *
184	     * @return the derived identity key
185	     */
